{title: 031 - Tell Out, My Soul}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Worship}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[D]Tell [F#m]out, [A]my [D]soul, [Bm]the [A]greatness [D]of [Em]the [F#m]Lord:
[G]Unnumbered [A]blessings [G]give [F#m]my [Em]spirit voice;
[F#m]Tender [A]to [Bm]me [A7]the [C]promise [G]of [A]His [Bm]word;
[D]In God [F#m/C#]my [Bm]Savior [F#m]shall [G]my [A]heart [F#m]rejoice.

Verse 2:
[D]Tell [F#m]out, [A]my [D]soul, [Bm]the [A]greatness [D]of [Em]His [F#m]name:
[G]Make [F#m]known [Em]His [A]might, [Bm]the [G]deeds [F#m]His [Em]arm [D]has [Em]done;
[F#m]His [G]mercy [Bm]sure, [A7]from [C]age [Bm]to [G]age [A]the [Bm]same;
[D]His holy [Bm]name, [A]the [F#m]Lord, [G]the [A]Mighty [D]One.

Verse 3:
[D]Tell [F#m]out, [A]my [D]soul, [Bm]the [A]greatness [D]of [Em]His [F#m]might:
[G]Pow'rs [F#m]and [Em]dominions [G]lay [F#m]their [Em]glory by;
[F#m]Proud [G]hearts [A]and [Bm]stubborn [C]wills [Bm]are [G]put [A]to [Bm]flight,
[D]The hungry [Bm]fed, [A]the [F#m]humble [A]lifted [D]high.

Verse 4:
[D]Tell [F#m]out, [A]my [D]soul, [Bm]the [A]glories [D]of [Em]His [F#m]word:
[G]Firm [F#m]is [Em]His [A]promise, [G]and [F#m]His [Em]mercy sure.
[F#m]Tell [G]out, [A]my [Bm]soul, [A7]the [C]greatness [G]of [A]the [Bm]Lord
[D]To children's [Bm]children [F#m]and [G]forever [D]more.
